    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδια-νέμω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distribute together with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτοὺς . . τοῖς καλοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					45.27
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1024c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1082b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.391
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νεύω</span>, <i>slew</i> or
