				Plb.
				1.23.10
			</span></i>: c. dat. instr., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ προσώπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.63b
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῇ διανοίᾳ ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.38.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
